    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100910/extras/bbc79a72f6749671ade9f5fac3d0deda.poster.avif?t=1723083377\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100910/extras/bbc79a72f6749671ade9f5fac3d0deda.webm?t=1723083377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100910/extras/bbc79a72f6749671ade9f5fac3d0deda.mp4?t=1723083377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Play with my Balls</strong> is an exciting action-puzzle game where you shake, aim, and shoot balls into their respective holes. Engage in thrilling challenges by destroying enemy balls and collecting coins along the way. Master the art of precision to sink all the balls accurately and dominate the ball kingdom. Conquer various locations and make them shine brightly under your stars as you strive to become the ultimate ruler of the ball realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100910/extras/64acd74a7b3e154398b39c5f0b4b5133.poster.avif?t=1723083377\" width=594 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100910/extras/64acd74a7b3e154398b39c5f0b4b5133.webm?t=1723083377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100910/extras/64acd74a7b3e154398b39c5f0b4b5133.mp4?t=1723083377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging Gameplay: Combine action and puzzle-solving to sink balls into holes.<br></li><li>Enemy Balls: Destroy opponent balls to clear your path.<br></li><li>Coin Collection: Gather coins to boost your score and unlock new levels.<br></li><li>Precision Shooting: Master the skills to accurately sink all balls.<br></li><li>Kingdom Conquest: Rule over various locations and make them shine under your command.</li></ul>",
